    'the <span style="color: #002699; font-weight:700;">leading strand</span> is only synthesized by a single polymerase, while <span style="color: #995c00; font-weight:700;">lagging strand</span> uses more than one',
    'the <span style="color: #995c00; font-weight:700;">lagging strand</span> is synthesized by multiple polymerases, while <span style="color: #002699; font-weight:700;">leading strand</span> only uses one',
  ],
